@startuml UseCase_D_GroupUngroup
title Use Case D: 群組/解散群組物件 (Group/Ungroup)

actor User
participant __anUMLEditor__ as UMLEditor
participant __aCanvas__  as Canvas
participant __aCompositeObject__ as CompositeObject
participant __aBasicObject1__ as BasicObject1
participant __aBasicObject2__ as BasicObject2

note over UMLEditor: Precondition: Select按鈕被按下

== Case 1: 群組物件 ==

User -> UMLEditor: 當有≥2個物件處於被select狀態時
User -> UMLEditor: 使用者到Edit Menu點選Group選項

UMLEditor -> Canvas ++ : groupSelected()
Canvas -> Canvas ++ : 1. 遍歷所有圖形找出被select的(selected=true)
Canvas -->> Canvas -- : return
Canvas -> Canvas ++ : 2. 檢查selectedShapes.size() >= 2
Canvas -->> Canvas -- : return

alt 數量足夠
Canvas -> CompositeObject ++ : new CompositeObject()
CompositeObject -->> Canvas -- : (建立)
Canvas -> Canvas ++ : 遍歷selectedShapes清單
Canvas -->> Canvas -- : (開始迴圈)

loop 每個被選取的物件
Canvas -> BasicObject1 ++ : setSelected(false)
BasicObject1 -->> Canvas -- : return
Canvas -> CompositeObject ++ : addComponent(BasicObject1)
CompositeObject -> CompositeObject ++ : components.add()\nupdateBounds()
CompositeObject -->> CompositeObject -- : return
CompositeObject -->> Canvas -- : return
Canvas -> Canvas ++ : shapes.remove(BasicObject1)
Canvas -->> Canvas -- : return
end

Canvas -> CompositeObject ++ : setSelected(true)
CompositeObject -->> Canvas -- : return
Canvas -> Canvas ++ : 3. shapes.add(CompositeObject)
Canvas -->> Canvas -- : return
Canvas -> Canvas ++ : repaint()
Canvas -->> Canvas -- : return

else Alternative D.1: 只有1個物件被選取
Canvas -> Canvas : 不會有任何動作
end

== Case 2: 解散群組 ==

User -> UMLEditor: 當唯一1個composite物件被select時
User -> UMLEditor: 使用者到Edit Menu點選Ungroup選項

UMLEditor -> Canvas: ungroupSelected()
Canvas -> Canvas: 1. 遍歷所有圖形找出被select的
Canvas -> Canvas: 2. 檢查selectedShapes.size()==1 && isGroup()
note right of Canvas: 用多型 isGroup() 取代 instanceof CompositeObject

alt 條件符合 (是群組)
Canvas -> Canvas: shapes.remove(composite)
Canvas -> CompositeObject: getComponents() [Shape 多型介面]
CompositeObject -> Canvas: 回傳components清單

loop 每個子圖形
Canvas -> BasicObject1: 3. shapes.add(BasicObject1)
end

Canvas -> Canvas: repaint()

else Alternative D.2: ≥2個物件被選取或非群組
Canvas -> Canvas: 不會有任何動作
end

@enduml